OL,5,G0400 Agony
OL,6,     FMichael feels left behind as
OL,7,     Fothers succeed. He tries to
OL,8,     Fconfide in Jane, but her heavy
OL,9,     Fpregnancy leaves her little time
OL,10,     Fto listen.
OL,11,G0430 Stereo Underground
OL,12,     FRichard Latto presents alternative
OL,13,     Fanthems from a music community
OL,14,     Fwith attitude.
OL,15,G0530 Jack Hargreaves' Old Country
OL,16,     FJack goes rabbiting with nets, the
OL,17,     Fway it has been done for over 800
OL,18,     Fyears. He describes what the
OL,19,     Fvisitor should look for on a trip
OL,20,     Fto the countryside.
